  "sourceRulesPath": "sources/editorial/lost-object-recovery/directions/source-rules.json",
  "entries": [
    {
      "movingLine": 1,
      "changedTrigram": "巽",
      "text": "东南与木器之内是传统提示。若原收纳涉及木柜或木盒，可先托能查看的人看清内部，原处有权限和实物线索以后再安排前往。",
      "sourceRule": "巽",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:21:23.517Z",
      "textSha256": "353740356b6c5228b25be54d6a31d8506f8979ba3fcb1069dc8f3096b5f4536e"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 2,
      "changedTrigram": "离",
      "text": "方位取象偏南，离列明窗、文书之侧。最后一次使用若与文件整理有关，可从原台面逐项核收拾经过，查找保持实在有序。",
      "sourceRule": "离",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:21:23.519Z",
      "textSha256": "4bc841736e35e89afcc03a68dd9f56f2cef761404314d171a2e6fcc02c4b2bcb"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 3,
      "changedTrigram": "兑",
      "text": "西方是变兑的传统方向，场所参泽畔、破壁。实际行程相合时，可请管理方核原停留处，查验请求说清楚，领取仍凭原物特征。",
      "sourceRule": "兑",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:21:23.519Z",
      "textSha256": "8155b7d9aeb129ae5d316429e2495292e8c0651e18f139d6d2d00d9ff6f460be"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 4,
      "changedTrigram": "坤",
      "text": "方位参西南，仓储、方器属于坤象。若查看条件已有进展，可请经手方核最后实际收放的一批物件，盒格内部也要查到。",
      "sourceRule": "坤",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:21:23.519Z",
      "textSha256": "8920431e1f7b020134253c7cd1bc954a82624680e70012ff3087fd77b32e34e1"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 5,
      "changedTrigram": "兑",
      "text": "传统方向偏西，兑的场所见水泽边与败垣。若原路线涉及这些地方，可保存对应招领回复，向现场管理方核当时是否收存过相似物。",
      "sourceRule": "兑",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:21:23.519Z",
      "textSha256": "47a41d7dbd080eb39f0a965b212f87883209a12248112e5b7436802606e66233"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 6,
      "changedTrigram": "离",
      "text": "南方与明窗、文书旁是变离的线索。眼下查法卡住时，可回核原来真实使用过的文件台，把能补看的收放细节先问清。",
      "sourceRule": "离",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:21:23.519Z",
      "textSha256": "079c42938dd56bc2ba2605fafa6870d2662ab1af1d03bad731e18b8c645286ba"
    }
  ]
}
